{%- comment -%}
  Renders the Frood right-arrow icon (→) as inline SVG. Recolours via
  currentColor (set `color` on a parent — same pattern as the other icon-*).
  Natural size is 16×12; consumers override sizing/animation with the `class`
  param + their own CSS.

  Owner: header.liquid (with the other icon-* snippets).
  Used by: bundle-builder (add-to-cart CTA), recipe-card ("Watch" trigger).

  Expects (optional):
    class — extra class(es) on the <svg>, e.g. 'bundle-add-icon',
            'recipe-card-watch-icon'
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg
  {%- if class != blank %} class="{{ class }}"{%- endif %}
  width="16"
  height="12"
  viewBox="0 0 16 12"
  fill="currentColor"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
  <path d="M10 12L8.6 10.55L12.15 7H0V5H12.15L8.6 1.45L10 0L16 6L10 12Z"/>
</svg>
